---@alias gcp.gkeonprem_v1.BareMetalNodePoolStateEnum "STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"PROVISIONING"|"RUNNING"|"RECONCILING"|"STOPPING"|"ERROR"|"DEGRADED"

---BareMetalNodePoolUpgradePolicy defines the node pool upgrade policy.
---@class gcp.gkeonprem_v1.BareMetalNodePoolUpgradePolicy
---@field parallelUpgradeConfig? gcp.gkeonprem_v1.BareMetalParallelUpgradeConfig The parallel upgrade settings for worker node pools.

---Specifies operating system settings for cluster provisioning.
---@class gcp.gkeonprem_v1.BareMetalOsEnvironmentConfig
---@field packageRepoExcluded? boolean Whether the package repo should not be included when initializing bare metal machines.

