---@field folder? string The name of the vCenter folder for the admin cluster.
---@field resourcePool? string The name of the vCenter resource pool for the admin cluster.
---@field address? string The vCenter IP address.
---@field datacenter? string The name of the vCenter datacenter for the admin cluster.

